*  earn0_inline_control.sno - EARN-0 hand-check CONTROL (2026-08-11 s27).
*  Character-identical pattern to earn0_stored_varref/earn0_stored_capture, but written
*  INLINE in the match statement instead of stored in a variable first.
*  AT HEAD fc5b0754 THIS IS CORRECT. It is the passing sibling that makes the stored-form
*  divergence a class boundary rather than a flake (RULES: nearest passing sibling first).
        P = LEN(1)
        'abc' POS(0) P $ V LEN(2) RPOS(0)        :S(Y)F(N)
Y       OUTPUT = 'MATCH V=[' V ']'               :(D)
N       OUTPUT = 'NOMATCH'
D       OUTPUT = 'DONE'
END
